// The application's icon, as resource 1: the id GPUI loads for its window
// class, and so what the taskbar, Alt-Tab and the title bar show.
//
// aidiction.ico is data/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/app.akergez.Aidiction.svg
// rendered at 16, 24, 32, 48, 64 and 256 pixels; see build.rs.
1 ICON "aidiction.ico"
